commit f4d821a72f2f0f4ea22c2f24426f776c13b5b255
Author: Prasad Shirvalkar <prasad.shirvalkar@ucsf.edu>
Date:   Sat Jun 27 03:01:47 2026 -0700

    CS-3: PSD->LSB bridge for PSD-only patient-triggered snapshot events
    
    Gives the patient-triggered LFP snapshot events (PatientControllerEvent,
    incl. Streaming) — which carry a device onboard-FFT spectrum (FFTBinData)
    but NO time domain — a calibrated modeled LSB, via a bridge derived from
    the device's own montage surveys.
    
    Units (CS3 recon, RCS08 paired fit n=10476):
    - event FFTBinData is LINEAR uV magnitude (same unit as survey
      LFPMagnitude), baseline-subtracted so ~1/3 of bins read slightly
      negative (sub-noise-floor). Paired FFTBinData<->LFPMagnitude slope~1,
      ratio~1.04. Reconciliation = clamp negatives to 0. (Corrected the stale
      taxonomy 'log/dB' units label, which CS-3 disproved.)
    
    Montage TD<->PSD law (surveys carry TD + device-PSD on the SAME recording):
    - PSD_bp = K_TD_PSD * TD_bp, K_TD_PSD = 4.789 (geomean, 95% CI
      [4.772,4.806]; slope 1.022, r=0.987; offset 6.80 dB ~ the ~6 dB
      onboard-FFT-vs-Welch note; per-contact K 4.73-4.87). Same band-power
      definition both sides (sum of squared in-band magnitudes) fixed the
      earlier loose r=0.62/slope=0.57.
    
    Compose:
    - LSB = LSB_PER_UV2_TRANSFORM * TD_bp and TD_bp = PSD_bp / K_TD_PSD give
      LSB = (352.62/4.789) * PSD_bp = LSB_PER_DEVICE_PSD * PSD_bp, ~73.63.
      End-to-end check on montage (LSB via bridge vs direct TD->LSB): geomean
      fold 1.000 (unbiased), scatter 1.21x, r=0.987.
    
    Wiring:
    - analytics: constants LSB_PER_UV2_DEVICE_PSD_TD_RATIO=4.789,
      LSB_PER_DEVICE_PSD~73.63; helpers clamp_device_psd,
      device_psd_band_power, device_psd_to_lsb.
    - availability.lsb_series: new event_psd_recordings param + a psd_modeled
      bridge tier (modeled=True, method=event_psd_bridge_x_k=73.63), restricted
      to [LSB_VALIDATED_HZ_LO, LSB_DEPLOYABLE_HZ_HI]. Never preferred over
      native, never deployable.
    - bravo_service: _event_psd_lsb_blocks (reuses _event_psd_rows, attaches
      center from sensing config else in-band spectral peak); wired into the
      timeline assembler. ONLY patient events route here — montage/survey
      products carry TD and use the direct transform (they are the bridge's
      calibration source).
    
    Verified e2e on RCS08: 3119 bridge LSB points, all source=psd_modeled /
    modeled=True, centers in [7.8,22.5], LSB median 522.
    
    Tests: +8 (6 bridge invariants/conversion, 2 taxonomy). Suite 219/219.

